WEBVTT

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:16.730
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:27.740
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but reality moves on.</i>

00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:33.270
<i>Treat love as love, treat</i>
<i>dreams as dreams.</i>

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:38.780
<i>It's difficult to say it in earnest.</i>
<i>The times forge ahead, but...</i>

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:43.760
<i>I want to make you happy...</i>

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:49.490
<i>I'll do so like I do to</i>
<i>be myself. Yeah!</i>

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:54.520
<i>I'll make you happy...</i>

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:59.940
<i>I dedicate all that</i>
<i>I can do to you.</i>

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:11.250
<i>Along a zigzag the world turns,</i>
<i>I heave out a sigh.</i>

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:23.500
<i>Someone pauses along the way,</i>
<i>but love doesn't stop for me.</i>

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:33.530
Damn! I'm late!

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:50.680
Hey! Why don't you watch
where you're going?!

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:52.980
Do you work at Bokuto
Station?

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:56.320
Huh?

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:04.740
What are these?

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.040
"Women's Changing Room"

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:10.070
They're for me?

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:14.740
Like I said... He didn't give his name, and
he was wearing dark sunglasses.

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:17.280
He seemed pretty
stuck-up.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:21.320
Hmm... white roses... a sports
car with tinted glass...

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:24.020
...and a mystery man wearing
sunglasses.

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:26.020
This could be
a juicy one.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:28.920
There you
go again!

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:31.120
You're blowing this out of proportion.
It's probably no big deal.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:34.190
Tsk... tsk... tsk...

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:37.240
So naive... There's definitely
something to this.

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:39.530
Stop this. There
is not.

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:43.740
Anyway, we have to think about the VIP
coming to the station today.

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:44.640
What is it?

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.640
Aoi?

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:48.380
It can't be.

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:53.420
FILE. 24
A WHITE ROSE
FOR AOI

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:56.590
Come on, let's
hurry.

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:59.250
Hey, cool!

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:02.060
...and I will now introduce
you to him.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:05.620
This is the man who'll be Chief for
a Day here at Bokuto Station...

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:08.570
...the famous actor,
Go Kitakoji.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.200
That's the guy!

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:19.530
I knew it.

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:21.110
Is he that famous?

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:22.780
Is he that famous?
Don't you know him?!

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:25.420
In the Yoriko Nikaidou Most
Eligible Bachelor List...

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:27.780
...he ranks in
the top five!

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:31.390
He sings, he dances,
he's a superstar...

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:33.320
...and his name
is Go Kitakoji!

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:34.790
Oh.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.660
I'm Go Kitakoji.

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:40.200
This is my second time
as Chief for a Day...

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:41.990
...and I look forward to
working with you.

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:54.050
A superstar, huh?

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:57.210
Who, me?

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:58.410
That's right.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:04.050
Mr. Kitakoji has specifically asked
for you to assist him today.

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.920
I'm counting on you.

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:09.650
Yes, sir.

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:11.800
By the way, I
heard that...

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:14.920
...you acted as his assistant once
before, at another police station.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.140
That's right.

00:04:16.140 --> 00:04:17.830
That's right.
Then I'm sure you'll understand...

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:20.400
...that you're not just going
to be his assistant...

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:22.500
...but you are to act as his
bodyguard, as well.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:25.870
So keep on your toes...
and be careful.

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:27.010
Yes, sir.

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:28.950
Hello. Come in.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.750
Hello. Come in.
Excuse me.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:34.480
Hello. I'll be acting as your assistant
today. My name is Aoi...

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:37.380
Hi! We meet again,
Aoi Futaba.

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:44.190
I didn't know you'd transferred
to Bokuto Station.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:45.850
It's been a
long time.

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:48.190
I hope it's not too much trouble,
helping me out today.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:50.360
I'll be counting
on you.

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:52.910
Sure.

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:03.110
"Chief for a Day"

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.480
<i>"This really is a beautiful</i>
<i>garden."</i>

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.320
<i>"It is. Oh!"</i>

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:16.460
<i>"Wow! White roses."</i>

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:18.600
<i>"Do you like them?"</i>

00:05:19.970 --> 00:05:22.960
<i>"Yes... Did you</i>
<i>know...</i>

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:24.830
<i>"...that white roses</i>
<i>mean...</i>

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:27.630
<i>"...you respect the person</i>
<i>you give them to?"</i>

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:29.710
<i>"Really?"</i>

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:34.770
Aoi!

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:36.110
Aoi, are you
listening?!

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:39.010
Huh?

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:39.990
What's gotten into you?

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:41.510
S... Sorry.

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:45.950
I'm not surprised! You have to hang
out with that gorgeous hunk.

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:47.490
And he specifically
asked for you!

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:50.730
He's not my type. Too stuck-up!

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:51.490
Mm-hmm...

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:55.170
You two wouldn't know a good
man if he fell on your head!

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:57.360
Natsumi, you've got a thing
for older men, and you...

00:05:57.470 --> 00:06:00.370
...Miyuki... your taste is way
down at Nakajima's level.

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:02.500
Now hold it right there!
Now hold it right there!

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:05.640
Ah! Why couldn't I be the one
picked to be his guide?!

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:06.880
Because...

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.440
...if we left it to you...

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:12.950
...you'd screw up somehow. You'd annoy him
to death with your incessant chatter...

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:15.650
...and besides, femininity
is the key here.

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:17.910
Oh? Femininity!

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:20.720
But Aoi's a man!

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:25.990
That's it! Kitakoji doesn't even know
what a real woman can be!

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:28.330
The beauty of a
perfect figure...

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:31.700
...the sublime charms of
femininity. That's it!

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:33.530
Oh...

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:37.370
Sorry. I wouldn't know
about that stuff.

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:39.800
Hey! We're ready
to go!

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:40.780
Uh-oh!

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:44.470
We've got to take care of traffic,
so let's go on ahead.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.610
Good luck, Aoi!

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:49.690
Oh, Aoi! I envy
you so much!

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:51.350
Come on!
Hop to it!

00:06:52.630 --> 00:06:55.890
"Go Kitakoji is here!"

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:58.360
"Traffic Safety"
"Let's obey traffic laws!"

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:11.380
Mr. Kitakoji.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:13.300
I've brought you a cloth to
freshen up with.

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:15.340
Would you like something
cold to drink?

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:18.810
Sorry to put you to
so much trouble.

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:22.310
Not at all. This
is my job.

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:24.760
Your job...

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:25.780
Pardon?

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:29.160
Nothing... Thank you.

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:30.560
Who's that chick?

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:33.790
I don't know, but what's she
doing with our Kitakoji?

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.360
Oh! It's Aoi!

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:37.900
Hi!

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:39.540
Aoi! Show us your underpants!

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:40.800
Oh my.

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:43.510
Are you finished with kindergarten
for today?

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:45.740
My mom asked me
to go to the store.

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:49.570
Did she now? Oh, I know.
Just a minute, okay?

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:54.350
Here. You can have these.

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:56.080
Wow! Thank you!

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:04.090
You there! Please
move right along.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:05.850
There sure are a
lot of people.

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:08.690
Yeah. Look at Aoi. Seems
like things are going well.

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:11.700
No kidding. She's really
good at that.

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:12.870
Aoi?

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:15.740
Will you come and play with us
again at Wakaba Kindergarten?

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:18.540
Sure I will.
I promise.

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:21.040
Promise!

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:22.780
Bye-bye!

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:26.990
Excuse me?

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:27.950
Uh...

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:28.610
Huh?

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:30.450
Oh yes, back
to work.

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:34.320
I don't like that chick's
act. Not one bit...

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:35.930
Let's get her good.

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:38.460
Yeah. As soon
as she's alone.

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:41.630
All right, Aoi, I'm just going
to keep on signing here...

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:43.790
...so could you get me some
more pamphlets?

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:44.960
Sure.

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:52.440
Let's see now. Where could
those pamphlets be?

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:55.170
Got them!

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:06.120
Who are you?! What
do you want?!

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:08.060
Shut up!

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:12.260
Ah!

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:14.870
Take that!

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:32.610
Take this!

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:55.330
Stop it!

00:09:58.440 --> 00:10:00.670
Get out! And don't bother
coming back!

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:02.940
Dammit!

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.210
We won't forget this!

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:14.650
Aoi?

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:16.690
I... I'm fine.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:20.130
I'm not hurt or anything.
I'm just a little shaken.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:24.330
If only I'd been
more careful.

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:26.130
I'm sorry.

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:30.370
Don't say that!
I'm really fine!

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:33.100
Uh... Ah...

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:35.470
No. You are
not fine.

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:39.510
You sit here and calm
your nerves a bit.

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:42.520
Th... Thank you.

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:46.720
I'll go get you
some water.

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:47.720
Thanks.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:28.260
"Bokuto Station Chief for a Day"

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:01.990
Aoi? I mean...
Miss Aoi?

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:03.030
Yes?

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:07.400
Do you... are you... well, I mean,
are you seeing anyone?

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:09.870
Uh... no.

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:16.040
In that case...

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:18.270
...would you consider...

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:20.080
...would you be my...

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:23.090
It's really him!

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:25.050
I love you!

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.520
Aoi!

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:52.450
"Guestroom for Mr. Go Kitakoji"

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:04.130
Mr. Kitakoji?

00:13:04.230 --> 00:13:06.420
Huh?

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:11.970
"I'm up on the roof... -
Kitakoji."

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:35.890
Hi.

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:40.120
W... What are you doing?
That's dangerous!

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.030
I... uh...

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:45.470
...was just trying to work
up some courage.

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:46.630
"Courage?"

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:52.670
Anyway, I got carried
away...

00:13:52.780 --> 00:13:54.540
...because the sunset
is so nice.

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:56.700
The sunset?

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:15.370
It's beautiful
up here.

00:14:15.530 --> 00:14:16.760
Yes.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.670
Do you remember...

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:23.210
...the first time
we met?

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:24.240
Yes.

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:29.370
<i>"I respect you?"</i>

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:33.110
<i>"Many flowers may have different</i>
<i>meanings, like love and such...</i>

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:36.850
<i>"...but no flower can convey the meaning</i>
<i>of a person's true value...</i>

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:42.830
<i>"...as faithfully as white roses</i>
<i>can. That's why I love them."</i>

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:49.260
That was all you said to me, but your
words touched me deeply.

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:55.440
Someone to be respected by another...
Someone who can respect another...

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:03.050
I wonder if I can be the kind of
person that you're thinking of.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.060
Would you
marry me?

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:21.730
There you have it.

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:24.000
Perrrfect!

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.730
There you are, Aoi!

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:32.310
Come on! Let's
go to the party!

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:33.470
Uh, all right.

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:35.440
What's with you?

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:37.480
Uh... Nothing at all.

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:39.750
She's just tired.

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:41.290
It must have been
exhausting today.

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:44.010
Yeah, I guess. Nice
work, Aoi.

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:46.590
Hey, Aoi! What do you
think of my dress?!

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:49.490
I'm going to knock Kitakoji dead
with this dress, for sure!

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:52.560
And I'll show him the charms
of a real woman!

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:56.200
No kidding. Well,
whoopee for you.

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:59.770
"A real woman..."

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:02.900
Oh yeah! Aoi, did you get
me his autograph?

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:04.440
Oops! Sorry!

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:06.080
Why don't you get it
from him yourself?

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:07.910
I will!

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:09.740
Come on! Let's go!

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:12.080
We'll wait for you
downstairs.

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:13.080
Uh...

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:15.450
Thanks, but don't bother.
You go on ahead.

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:17.750
I've got to clean up
some things first.

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:19.020
Really?

00:16:19.190 --> 00:16:21.160
Then, see you there.

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:37.310
<i>"You're the first woman</i>
<i>I've ever really loved."</i>

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:40.110
<i>"You are so gentle,</i>
<i>brave, and bright."</i>

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:46.040
<i>"You're the perfect</i>
<i>woman for me."</i>

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.720
<i>"I respect you."</i>

00:16:55.990 --> 00:17:00.590
<i>"Will you marry me?"</i>

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:38.500
"Closed. Private Function."

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:43.610
Well...

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:45.940
Thank you all very much
for your help today.

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:47.680
Cheers!

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:48.740
Cheers!
Cheers!

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:52.570
Whoa! That hits
the spot!

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.410
Natsumi, don't drink too much
or you'll pay for it later!

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:57.560
I know, I know!

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:00.250
I wonder what's
keeping Aoi?

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:02.050
She's still not
here yet?

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:04.820
Maybe she's just taking a
long time cleaning up.

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:07.360
She likes things
just so, right?

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:08.730
Hmm...

00:18:28.820 --> 00:18:29.760
Hey!

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:31.590
What is it?

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.260
Isn't that Aoi?

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:34.230
No way!

00:18:34.230 --> 00:18:35.390
What?!

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:38.150
Yo! Aoi baby! Over
here! Over here!

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:40.530
Oh, Natsumi!

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:43.030
Excuse me.

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:52.600
You look so different.
You surprised me.

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:55.710
We have to talk.

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:56.700
Hmm?

00:18:58.220 --> 00:19:00.880
I see. So I'm not good
enough for you.

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:04.220
No! No, you're a
wonderful man.

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:07.090
Then what is it?

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:24.530
The problem is me.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:28.140
I'm...

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.300
I'm a...

00:19:29.410 --> 00:19:31.780
I'm really a...

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:08.880
I see.

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:10.480
So that's how it is.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:20.830
But I'm glad...

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:23.090
...that you weren't
just acting.

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:27.500
Otherwise, I'd be
out of a job.

00:20:29.070 --> 00:20:31.570
It is a magnificent
performance.

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:37.980
I can't... I can't... love
you like that.

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:40.050
But...

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:43.350
Here...

00:20:43.460 --> 00:20:45.010
Take this.

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:58.530
Could you tell us your feelings
about being Chief for a Day?

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:02.000
Well, I met all kinds
of people...

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:04.870
...and somehow it turned out
to be a real eye opener.

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:07.070
Hey! Hurry! It's
already started!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:11.110
I noticed that rose in your lapel.
Could you tell us about it?

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:13.750
Huh? Oh, this?

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:17.580
Perhaps a gift, from
a special friend?

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:18.980
Yes, that's right.

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:21.650
Well, she's got to
be very special...

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:24.130
...to capture your heart,
Mr. Kitakoji!

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:29.560
Actually... the white rose signifies
respect for a person.

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:31.630
Pardon?

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:33.700
I guess what I'm trying
to say is...

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:37.040
...that I've met a beautiful person who will
always have a special place in my heart.

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:40.510
Huh? What's he
talking about?!

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:08.010
<i>I live my life my own way, doing</i>
<i>things others wouldn't.</i>

00:22:12.340 --> 00:22:20.190
<i>Being strong isn't enough.</i>
<i>It makes me lonely.</i>

00:22:22.890 --> 00:22:31.200
<i>I can feel your presence</i>
<i>as if you're right here...</i>

00:22:31.730 --> 00:22:39.300
<i>... but I can't say a word.</i>

00:22:40.840 --> 00:22:48.040
<i>The feelings I hide within might</i>
<i>break into pieces...</i>

00:22:49.580 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>But if I don't say anything,</i>
<i>nothing can begin.</i>

00:22:57.290 --> 00:23:04.520
<i>The wind gently blows...</i>
<i>Time flows...</i>

00:23:04.700 --> 00:23:14.240
<i>Time flows... And soon</i>
<i>I can be honest...</i>

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:17.340
<i>Thank you,</i>
<i>friend!</i>

00:23:23.520 --> 00:23:25.310
"Clash of the Titans"

00:23:26.950 --> 00:23:28.420
It's "Natsumi's Fan Letter Corner!"

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:29.750
Ta-da!

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:32.820
"Your home runs
turn me on!"

00:23:32.920 --> 00:23:34.890
...says "Baseball Boy"
in Chofu City.

00:23:34.990 --> 00:23:36.980
"Please play on my
team next time."

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:38.090
What the?

00:23:38.260 --> 00:23:39.630
And the next letter is...

00:23:39.630 --> 00:23:40.200
Ta-da!

00:23:40.200 --> 00:23:42.060
"I'll be waiting for you at the finance
company, signed Strike Man."

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:43.340
He's calling you out!

00:23:43.340 --> 00:23:44.930
Gulp!

00:23:45.100 --> 00:23:46.910
Next time, You're Under
Arrest, File 25...

00:23:46.970 --> 00:23:48.210
..."Run, Strike Man, Run!"

00:23:48.340 --> 00:23:50.340
Another home run, tomorrow!
